Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(prompt):=20agent.global=5Fcontext=5Ffiles?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20user-level=20rules=20(e.g.=20~/AGENTS.md)=20in?=
